# Analytics on the customer messages (AnalyticsService, /service/analytics)
#
# MessageAnalytics supports the OData data aggregation extension: $apply with groupby, aggregate
# and filter. Start the app with `npm run cds-watch` (http://localhost:4004). The messages are
# classified by the AI when they are read, so read the messages once (see messages.http) for
# category, urgency and sentiment to be filled. The users are the mocked users.

@host = http://localhost:4004

### Messages per country
# expect: 200
GET {{host}}/service/analytics/MessageAnalytics?$apply=groupby((originatingCountry),aggregate($count%20as%20messages))&$orderby=messages%20desc,originatingCountry
Authorization: Basic viewer viewer

### Messages per category and urgency
# expect: 200
GET {{host}}/service/analytics/MessageAnalytics?$apply=groupby((messageCategory,messageUrgency),aggregate($count%20as%20messages))
Authorization: Basic viewer viewer

### Average priority score per category
# expect: 200
GET {{host}}/service/analytics/MessageAnalytics?$apply=groupby((messageCategory),aggregate(priorityScore%20with%20average%20as%20averageScore))&$orderby=averageScore%20desc
Authorization: Basic viewer viewer

### Totals of all messages: count, lowest, highest and average priority score
# expect: 200
GET {{host}}/service/analytics/MessageAnalytics?$apply=aggregate($count%20as%20messages,priorityScore%20with%20min%20as%20lowest,priorityScore%20with%20max%20as%20highest,priorityScore%20with%20average%20as%20average)
Authorization: Basic viewer viewer

### Open messages per sentiment
# expect: 200
GET {{host}}/service/analytics/MessageAnalytics?$apply=filter(status%20eq%20'Open')/groupby((messageSentiment),aggregate(messageCount%20with%20sum%20as%20open))
Authorization: Basic viewer viewer

### Number of different countries
# expect: 200
GET {{host}}/service/analytics/MessageAnalytics?$apply=groupby((originatingCountry))&$count=true&$top=0
Authorization: Basic viewer viewer

### The view is read-only
# expect: 405
POST {{host}}/service/analytics/MessageAnalytics
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerMessageID": 9002
}
